@token = 请先调用 http/users.http 的登录接口，把返回的 data.token 粘贴到此处

### 分类列表（按 rank 升序）
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建分类
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "云计算",
  "rank": 5
}

### 分类详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新分类
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "前端工程化",
  "rank": 1
}

### 删除分类（分类下有课程时会被拒绝）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
